    "fullDescription": {
      "stringValue": "Hi, I'm FM Hugo Wernberg from Sweden. This is my beginner-friendly **1.e4 repertoire for White**, built around systems rather than theory, meaning **you'll learn plans and ideas, not endless lines to memorize.**\n\nI've chosen openings like the *Italian Game*, *Closed Sicilian*, and *King's Indian Attack* that give you clear, practical middlegame goals against all of Black's main replies. \n\nGood luck!\n\nHugo"
    },
    "description": {
